---
import { guaranteeTerms } from '../data/guarantee';
import { ph, site } from '../data/site';
import Legal from '../layouts/Legal.astro';
---

<Legal title="Terms of Service" description="The terms that apply when you use the Neurokov website." updated="October 10, 2026">
  <p data-ph={site.company ? ph('company') : undefined}>
    These terms apply to your use of this website, run by {site.legalName} (“we”, “us”). By using the site you
    agree to them. Client projects are covered by a separate written agreement, and that agreement wins if the two ever
    conflict.
  </p>
  {
    site.company && (
      <p data-ph={ph('company')}>
        We are {site.company.name}, company no. {site.company.number}. Registered office: {site.company.office}.
      </p>
    )
  }

  <h2>Using this site</h2>
  <p>
    You’re welcome to browse, share links and book calls. Please don’t try to disrupt the site, access it in ways it
    wasn’t built for or use it for anything unlawful.
  </p>

  <h2>Our content</h2>
  <p>
    The text, design, graphics and code on this site belong to Neurokov or are used with permission. Third-party names,
    such as the tools and platforms we mention, belong to their owners and are used only to describe what we work with.
    Their use doesn’t imply any partnership or endorsement.
  </p>

  <h2>No guarantees about the site itself</h2>
  <p>
    We work hard to keep this site accurate and available, but it’s provided “as is”. Descriptions of our services are
    general. What we deliver for you is defined in your written plan, including our guarantee.
  </p>

  {
    guaranteeTerms.length > 0 && (
      <Fragment>
        <h2>Our guarantee</h2>
        <p>Results, or you don’t pay. Your written plan sets out what we’ll deliver, and these terms apply to it.</p>
        <ul data-ph={ph('guarantee')}>
          {guaranteeTerms.map((t) => (
            <li>
              <strong>{t.term}.</strong> {t.text}
            </li>
          ))}
        </ul>
      </Fragment>
    )
  }

  <h2>Limitation of liability</h2>
  <p>
    To the fullest extent the law allows, Neurokov isn’t liable for any indirect or consequential loss arising from your
    use of this website.
  </p>

  <h2>Links to other sites</h2>
  <p>
    We link to services like Google Calendar. We’re not responsible for their content or practices, so please read
    their terms too.
  </p>

  <h2>Changes</h2>
  <p>We may update these terms from time to time. The date at the top shows when they last changed.</p>

  <h2>Contact</h2>
  <p>Questions about these terms: <a href={`mailto:${site.email}`}>{site.email}</a>.</p>
</Legal>
